              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Goober"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Sooo easy!! This is awesome, I saved this to use as manicotti just like it says but I was short on treats tonight so I whipped some up and filled them with baked apples &amp; topped with caramel sauce, so so yummy",
            "datePublished": "2010-05-23T19:41:42.660Z"
